              "value": "Business: YOUR BUSINESS NAME\nOpening hours: Saturday to Thursday, 10:00 to 20:00 (Asia/Dhaka). Friday closed.\nDelivery: Inside Dhaka 1-2 days (BDT 60). Outside Dhaka 3-5 days (BDT 120).\nPayment: Cash on delivery, bKash (send money to 01XXXXXXXXX and share the TrxID).\nReturns: Exchange within 3 days if the product is unused and in original packaging.\nContact: 01XXXXXXXXX (call/WhatsApp), hello@YOUR_DOMAIN.com",
